{"4832570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rescue Hornet", "steam_appid": 4832570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mining colony in a distant solar system far in deep space has been attacked by unknown aliens that emerged from far below the moon's surface. The survivors' only hope is the galaxy's latest search and rescue ship - The Rescue Hornet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the Rescue Hornet with its powerful claw arm, explore the deepest caverns of a hostile alien world, defend yourself from a variety of bizarre creatures, find upgrades along the way and most importantly - find and rescue all the survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/90f69b6469b4b92ba44face8f2b64829.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RESCUE HORNET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy's state of the art search and rescue ship is equipped with blaster cannons and a powerful claw arm. Upgrades found within the caves of the alien moon can be used to equip new abilities and upgrades to the ship. Be sure to explore everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/d1ba2466e8f7e501dec017c205dbcdd8.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE CLAW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rescue Hornet's claw arm is vital for success! Control mechanisms to solve puzzles, carry heavy objects, hold extra weaponry for added firepower or secure attacking creatures in place to render them defenceless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/46867ce5ee3484ac80c85e4c39edd9fa.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RESCUE SURVIVORS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the colonists have been taken alive and hidden deep underground. Your mission priority is to find and rescue all survivors. You will be rewarded for your efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/5a4c2026d6a7f9ac1fe7183491333794.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOSTILE ALIENS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground caverns of the moon are home to a variety of strange alien life that will destroy you if given the chance. Use all your tools if you want to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/efb45d6e43ab25cccd1fab48d62cddba.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HIDDEN SECRETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover all the mysteries hidden within the depths of this dangerous moon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mining colony in a distant solar system far in deep space has been attacked by unknown aliens that emerged from far below the moon's surface. The survivors' only hope is the galaxy's latest search and rescue ship - The Rescue Hornet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the Rescue Hornet with its powerful claw arm, explore the deepest caverns of a hostile alien world, defend yourself from a variety of bizarre creatures, find upgrades along the way and most importantly - find and rescue all the survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/90f69b6469b4b92ba44face8f2b64829.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RESCUE HORNET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy's state of the art search and rescue ship is equipped with blaster cannons and a powerful claw arm. Upgrades found within the caves of the alien moon can be used to equip new abilities and upgrades to the ship. Be sure to explore everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/d1ba2466e8f7e501dec017c205dbcdd8.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE CLAW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rescue Hornet's claw arm is vital for success! Control mechanisms to solve puzzles, carry heavy objects, hold extra weaponry for added firepower or secure attacking creatures in place to render them defenceless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/46867ce5ee3484ac80c85e4c39edd9fa.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RESCUE SURVIVORS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the colonists have been taken alive and hidden deep underground. Your mission priority is to find and rescue all survivors. You will be rewarded for your efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/5a4c2026d6a7f9ac1fe7183491333794.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOSTILE ALIENS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground caverns of the moon are home to a variety of strange alien life that will destroy you if given the chance. Use all your tools if you want to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/extras/efb45d6e43ab25cccd1fab48d62cddba.avif?t=1781961305\" width=777 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HIDDEN SECRETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover all the mysteries hidden within the depths of this dangerous moon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Take command of the galaxy's newest search and rescue ship, the Rescue Hornet, and venture into this metroidvania set on a hostile alien world. Use all your tools including your powerful claw arm to defend yourself from dangerous creatures, solve puzzles and search for survivors of an alien attack.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/522dc9fe508bbce37f6e0eb91efa099cebeb0f1c/header.jpg?t=1781961305", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/08103f377974f35aac4d37ebc223b24dc4da745b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781961305", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4832570/08103f377974f35aac4d37ebc223b24dc4da745b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781961305", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit (x64) Windows 7 or later<br>